<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Oct Department Store sales up 1.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Oct Department Store sales up 1.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales at Tokyo department stores in October rose 1.9 percent from a year earlier to 209.5 billion yen, the Japan Department Stores' Association said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
